                "\nRules: preserve Harshit Kumar's exact confirmed identity, contact links, education, official employment titles and dates. TCS stays System Engineer (AI Cloud), June 2025–Present. WaahAds stays Software Engineer, July 2024–May 2025. Preserve the exact scope: LangChain multi-agent prototypes; Qdrant RAG designed and tested; never turn them into production deployments. Do not add Airflow, TypeScript, Kubernetes, pytest, Django, PyTorch/TensorFlow, MCP, fine-tuning or any employer requirement absent from the catalog. Listed skill familiarity does not establish professional ownership. Keep all attested metrics unchanged in meaning, and never create new quantities. Select exact catalog claims or approved truthful alternatives, reorder and emphasize only; do not create new claim wording when no catalog-approved wording exists. Resume must be ATS-readable, concise, with experience/projects/skills/education/achievements and no unsupported assertions. Cover letter may connect documented experience to the role and state interest, but may not assert missing skills, shorter notice, relocation beyond North India, compensation acceptance, legal declarations or application submission. Salary target 7–10LPA fixed is a search target, not employer pay. Actual notice is 90 days with reduction unconfirmed. Generated content must be labelled as content requiring PDF creation and source review. Return safe_to_store=true only after checking every employment, date, skill, project and metric against master sources; list claim IDs/approved variants used plus genuine gaps in integrity_notes. No application answers, external communication, assessment or sensitive-document request.",
